## First visible implementation slice

0734 implements the local website MVP for steps 1–4, with aggregate synthesis
and a historical closed-operation pool. It contributes to 0726/0727 without
closing them or replacing the matched historical study. GitHub: #1342.

## September 14 strategy checkpoint

PR #1343 delivers the local observatory slice and scientific export corrections.
The causal design is not selected. First execute independent bounded evidence
audits 0735 (historical populations and milestone observation) and 0736 (country
selection and intervention timing); 0729 is their design-decision checkpoint, then
0730 performs analysis and 0732 writing. Release/publication work0726–0728/0731
continues separately. Astra/Fable reports are proposals with recorded corrections,
not a ratified protocol. Keep this tracker open after the MVP merge.
